Team Q&A — Who Answers What
Architecture & Security → Valza
Why httpOnly cookies? ADR-001 — XSS cannot steal tokens.
How do you prevent IDOR? can_access_ticket() on every by-ID endpoint.
Why integer PKs? ADR-003 — authorization is the guard.
What is the state machine? ticket_state.py — directed graph of allowed transitions.
Database & API → Paulina
How does create ticket work? requester_id from JWT, status=open, assignee null.
Why CHECK constraints? Dual validation with Pydantic — ADR-004.
How do attachments work? Metadata in Postgres, binary in MinIO, presigned download.
How do migrations work? Alembic, one at a time, I gatekeep schema changes.
Frontend & UX → Egzona
How is auth handled in frontend? Cookies via credentials:include — no JWT in JS.
How do pages differ by role? Nav.tsx + middleware + API scope.
What is the design system? tailwind.config.ts tokens — brand, status, priority colors.
Integration → Rrezart
How does assignment work end-to-end? Admin UI → PATCH assignee → agent queue updates.
What are shared components? ui/ folder — Button, Card, Modal used everywhere.
How do comments work? CommentThread → POST /comments → sanitize.py strips HTML.
DevOps & QA → Lis
How do you run locally? docker compose up --build — 5 services.
What does CI check? pytest 80%, eslint, tsc, build, pip-audit, npm audit.
How is production deployed? Contabo VPS, Caddy HTTPS, deploy.sh.
What is seed.py? Demo users + 14 tickets for testing and defense demo.
